WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:39.790 --> 01:42.250
Okay, time to get going!

01:52.760 --> 01:55.270
No, I wanna leave right now!

02:00.670 --> 02:03.390
Please wait one moment,
Waffle-sama.

02:03.710 --> 02:06.280
If you don't make
yourself look all nice,

02:06.280 --> 02:09.250
Houx-sama won't like you anymore.

02:10.220 --> 02:13.450
Be a good girl and just do as I say.

02:18.620 --> 02:20.690
Isn't that better, Waffle-sama?

02:20.690 --> 02:22.490
Yeah, I like it.

02:22.490 --> 02:24.260
You look wonderful.

02:24.760 --> 02:29.100
This way, Houx-sama won't be
able to take his eyes off you.

02:30.640 --> 02:32.130
Houx-sama~

02:32.370 --> 02:36.410
Waffle-sama, you have a lovely smile.

02:37.940 --> 02:42.140
Stop Gramps!
Nana's (Secret) Grand Plan.

02:43.420 --> 02:44.650
Chocolat-chan...

02:46.250 --> 02:47.590
Here you go.

02:49.050 --> 02:50.600
Looks appetizing, Vanilla!

02:51.020 --> 02:53.190
Would you like to eat them with me?

02:53.190 --> 02:53.690
Yeah!

02:58.120 --> 03:00.170
I'm jealous...

03:00.170 --> 03:04.240
of these sweets that you always
get from the Magical World.

03:05.740 --> 03:11.080
If I had a mother, I wonder if she'd
send me sweets like this too.

03:11.410 --> 03:12.480
Chocolat-chan...

03:14.010 --> 03:16.380
I got a little something
for ya right here!

03:17.280 --> 03:18.840
A souvenir!

03:21.340 --> 03:23.090
Gramps!

03:23.090 --> 03:24.320
Yo!

03:24.850 --> 03:26.850
Why are you here?

03:27.190 --> 03:29.350
How've you been?

03:29.350 --> 03:31.400
We've been just fine.

03:31.400 --> 03:33.630
W-what are you talking about?

03:33.630 --> 03:36.360
If you don't have a reason
to be here, then scram!

03:36.740 --> 03:39.370
You have to respect your elders!

03:41.410 --> 03:43.880
This is good.

03:43.880 --> 03:45.080
Where's the tea?

03:46.040 --> 03:47.380
Here. Have some.

03:50.080 --> 03:53.080
Hey Gramps, don't just barge
in here and eat our snacks!

03:54.690 --> 03:57.630
Hello, Mademoiselles.

03:57.920 --> 03:59.260
Ah! Robin!

04:02.030 --> 04:05.130
S-so long, Mademoiselles!

04:05.700 --> 04:07.160
Huh! Robin!

04:09.520 --> 04:12.440
Man, he ditched us again.

04:12.440 --> 04:14.710
This calls for Duke!

04:14.710 --> 04:17.240
Hey, Duke! What are you doing?

04:18.910 --> 04:23.080
I must leave on a journey
to rediscover myself.

04:23.080 --> 04:24.240
What!?

04:24.620 --> 04:26.890
That being said, so long!

04:26.890 --> 04:29.240
Hey wait, Duke!

04:29.520 --> 04:32.620
So just why are you here, anyway?

04:32.620 --> 04:34.120
Why am I here?

04:34.760 --> 04:38.250
I thought I would come and take
you guys on a vacation.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.460
Huh? A vacation?

04:40.460 --> 04:43.070
That's right, a vacation.

04:47.240 --> 04:49.970
Yo Chocolat! Let's get a move on!

04:49.970 --> 04:51.520
Houx! Saule!

04:52.110 --> 04:54.040
Turns out we're going too.

04:55.550 --> 04:57.520
Looks like it's gonna be fun.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.020
Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.740
Less talk, more action. Get on!

05:03.150 --> 05:04.450
Okay!

05:14.630 --> 05:16.500
Ah!  Houx-sama!

05:18.440 --> 05:20.710
Houx-samaaa~

05:23.980 --> 05:25.080
Waffle!

05:25.080 --> 05:27.470
I missed you so much, Houx-sama!

05:45.800 --> 05:48.200
Ahh, the ocean's so pretty.

05:50.270 --> 05:51.500
Isn't it, though?

05:54.370 --> 05:56.470
Chocolat, where's your grandpa?

05:57.640 --> 05:59.380
He wasn't with you guys?

06:00.010 --> 06:02.150
I've completely lost track of him.

06:02.150 --> 06:03.610
So where could he be?

06:09.620 --> 06:11.220
Gramps!

06:11.220 --> 06:15.660
So, having fun yet?
That's what we're here for.

06:15.660 --> 06:17.730
You've got to enjoy life a little more!

06:18.060 --> 06:22.100
Maybe you'd  "enjoy'' it a little
more if I whupped your butt!

06:22.100 --> 06:23.400
Heavens!

06:23.400 --> 06:24.230
Huh?

06:24.500 --> 06:27.640
How can you be doing something
so lewd in broad daylight?!

06:27.640 --> 06:30.110
Could you possibly be
any more shameless?

06:30.110 --> 06:33.950
Huh? You say something, old crone?

06:34.210 --> 06:36.700
I'm saying you have no shame.

06:39.210 --> 06:41.450
Calm down, you two.

06:41.450 --> 06:45.920
We're away at a resort,
so can't we all get along?

06:47.090 --> 06:50.430
Why don't you have a relaxing
cup of tea or something?

06:51.160 --> 06:56.770
A geezer like you should be
dozing off under the sun.

07:01.870 --> 07:04.940
That crone is such a cockblock.

07:05.280 --> 07:10.200
Now, Waffle-sama, let's not concern
ourselves with that old fossil.

07:10.200 --> 07:13.150
Jeez, what's up with those two?

07:26.100 --> 07:29.230
Ahh!  These clothes are cool!

07:29.230 --> 07:31.470
Yeah! They'd look perfect on you!

07:32.800 --> 07:35.430
Isn't this bracelet cute?

07:35.840 --> 07:37.280
It sure is!

07:37.280 --> 07:38.840
This stuff is cute?

07:39.940 --> 07:43.690
Then I'll show you
something even cuter!

07:43.690 --> 07:47.080
Agrandissement! Rune Sage!

07:48.150 --> 07:50.650
Fill the room with bears!

07:52.160 --> 07:53.740
B-bears?!

07:57.960 --> 08:01.200
How's this, Chocolat?
Bears are cute, right?

08:07.770 --> 08:11.710
When it comes to cute,
froggies can't be beat!

08:16.550 --> 08:18.620
Ah! What happened to the store?!

08:18.620 --> 08:19.720
Umm...

08:19.720 --> 08:22.490
there's a really good
explanation for all this...

08:22.490 --> 08:25.520
It was you guys?!
What the heck did you do?

08:27.890 --> 08:30.300
Argh, I can't take any more of this!

08:30.300 --> 08:32.990
My thoughts exactly!

08:32.990 --> 08:35.930
Agrandissement! Rune Sage!

08:35.930 --> 08:38.440
Build a bigger bear!

08:41.170 --> 08:44.640
Make my froggies grow!!

08:53.950 --> 08:55.310
Get them!

08:55.650 --> 08:58.050
Let's go!

08:58.050 --> 08:59.590
What's going on?

09:00.060 --> 09:03.020
Chocolat-chan,
what do we do??

09:10.370 --> 09:12.340
Now that's entertainment!

09:12.340 --> 09:13.690
Houx-sama, it's amazing.

09:14.010 --> 09:15.640
Is that so?

09:17.200 --> 09:23.250
I returned out of concern for Chocolat,
but I'll pretend I didn't see this.

09:30.790 --> 09:34.420
Oh~ I'm tired!
Totally exhausted!

09:34.690 --> 09:35.960
Me too.

09:35.960 --> 09:39.500
We managed to fix everything
with our magic.

09:39.500 --> 09:43.970
But if Gramps keeps this up, I don't
know how much more we can take.

09:44.400 --> 09:47.310
Your grandpa's got so much energy.

09:47.310 --> 09:50.480
Exactly! This isn't a vacation at all!

09:50.480 --> 09:52.940
What is Gramps thinking?

09:53.550 --> 09:56.210
I'm tired of this! I'm gonna ask
Gramps to take us home!

09:58.020 --> 09:59.780
I won't put up with him anymore!

09:59.780 --> 10:01.890
Wait! Chocolat-chan!

10:04.190 --> 10:06.060
Cut it out, Corne!

10:06.060 --> 10:07.790
I don't think I got your name...

10:07.790 --> 10:09.460
Hey! Gramps!

10:09.790 --> 10:12.500
What's up?

10:12.500 --> 10:14.570
You know what's "up."

10:14.570 --> 10:16.670
Why exactly did you come here?

10:16.670 --> 10:17.870
For a vacation.

10:17.870 --> 10:22.510
After all you've put me through,
it sure doesn't feel like one to me!

10:22.510 --> 10:25.020
Now now, cool down, Chocolat.

10:25.410 --> 10:28.280
I want to stay here for a
while and take it easy.

10:28.280 --> 10:31.180
Why don't you relax
for awhile with Vanilla?

10:31.680 --> 10:33.520
Go on, get out of here!

10:33.850 --> 10:36.390
I've had it with you, Gramps!

10:36.390 --> 10:38.530
I've had it with that old fossil!

10:38.530 --> 10:41.760
He needs to get what's coming to him!

10:44.020 --> 10:47.330
That man is nothing but trouble,

10:47.330 --> 10:51.540
especially when he
cavorts with women.

10:51.540 --> 10:55.940
Not to mention, he's a poor
influence on Waffle-sama.

10:55.940 --> 11:00.050
Such dishonorable behavior
makes me so angry!

11:00.050 --> 11:04.420
That's true! Plus he keeps
pushing his stuffed bear agenda.

11:04.420 --> 11:07.090
I'm sure he didn't mean any harm.

11:07.090 --> 11:11.780
And so, I came up with a good
idea for dealing with him.

11:14.090 --> 11:17.780
First, I'll transform
into a beautiful woman.

11:18.430 --> 11:21.530
Then Corne-dono will flirt with me...

11:21.870 --> 11:25.530
Then, we'll go on a date and I'll
make unreasonable demands.

11:25.530 --> 11:28.240
And give him a hard time.

11:28.240 --> 11:33.410
I see! You plan to annoy him so
much that he'll want to leave!

11:33.410 --> 11:36.000
He deserves it
for being so shameless.

11:36.280 --> 11:38.120
Just watch and see, Gramps!

11:55.330 --> 11:56.970
Time to put the plan in action.

12:03.500 --> 12:05.640
Amazing!

12:07.710 --> 12:08.950
Hi!

12:08.950 --> 12:12.520
Oh, aren't you "Corne-san"
from the Magical World?

12:12.520 --> 12:14.500
Would you like to have some
divertissement...

12:14.850 --> 12:17.210
I mean, fun with me?

12:17.210 --> 12:19.920
Sure, if you'll have me!

12:20.290 --> 12:23.930
My name is Funny.
Nice to meet you, Corne-san.

12:23.930 --> 12:26.230
Nice to meet you, Funny-chan.

12:26.230 --> 12:28.930
Wait, how did you know my name?

12:28.930 --> 12:33.470
Oh, it's because you're so famous
in the Magical World!

12:33.470 --> 12:36.970
I'm that famous?!

12:36.970 --> 12:38.680
Come on, let's go on a date already!

12:39.810 --> 12:42.310
All right!
Begin the operation!

12:43.450 --> 12:46.960
I want to eat lots of escargot.

12:46.960 --> 12:49.150
E-escargot?

12:50.150 --> 12:51.660
Oh, is something wrong with that?

12:51.660 --> 12:53.860
Oh no no no.

12:53.860 --> 12:56.420
Gramps hates escargot!

12:58.700 --> 13:02.420
No, escargot's my favorite.

13:03.630 --> 13:05.870
Bon appetit!

13:08.870 --> 13:10.740
What, lost your appetite?

13:10.740 --> 13:12.710
Oh, not at all!

13:12.710 --> 13:14.450
Very strange.

13:14.450 --> 13:17.350
Chocolat said that he hated
escargot and yet..

13:21.650 --> 13:25.610
The joke's on her, I used magic
to turn them into bread rolls...

13:25.610 --> 13:28.870
that only look like escargot.

13:29.860 --> 13:32.080
Well played, Gramps.

13:32.830 --> 13:34.700
So, where should we go next?

13:34.700 --> 13:37.600
Let's see, I've always wanted...

13:37.600 --> 13:41.710
a legendary melon flower from
that deserted island out there.

13:41.710 --> 13:43.840
Can you pick one for me?

13:43.840 --> 13:45.240
All too easy!

13:53.810 --> 13:56.120
What? The engine stalled?

13:56.120 --> 13:57.790
What's going on?

13:57.790 --> 14:00.120
Agrandissement! Rune Sage!

14:00.120 --> 14:02.820
Machine, revive! Go!

14:05.830 --> 14:07.270
I failed.

14:07.270 --> 14:08.370
Leave it to us!

14:08.370 --> 14:10.270
Er, are we really doing this?

14:16.910 --> 14:19.000
Are those the ones?

14:19.000 --> 14:20.640
Let's go, Vanilla!

14:21.790 --> 14:24.550
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

14:27.850 --> 14:31.320
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

14:35.320 --> 14:37.960
Frogs, frogs, rain down upon us!

14:39.600 --> 14:41.200
Almost there.

14:47.640 --> 14:52.740
I won't let this
minor obstacle stop me!

14:53.540 --> 14:55.490
I made it!

14:56.910 --> 14:59.920
Impressive, Gramps.
But it's not over yet!

14:59.920 --> 15:01.950
Saule, it's up to you!

15:07.530 --> 15:11.640
What? Wha-wha-what's
going on here!

15:11.640 --> 15:15.470
Jeez, quit moving around!

15:23.840 --> 15:25.480
Funny-chan...

15:25.480 --> 15:26.880
Corne-san?

15:26.880 --> 15:27.940
Here's your flower...

15:28.480 --> 15:29.650
T-thank you.

15:30.980 --> 15:33.380
All...too...easy.

15:35.450 --> 15:36.990
Corne-san?

15:45.210 --> 15:49.470
Even the mighty Gramps would get tired
from running around so much.

15:49.470 --> 15:51.770
I wonder if he's about to give up.

15:54.070 --> 15:55.510
Gramps!

15:57.280 --> 15:59.710
Oh, if it isn't Chocolat and the crone.

15:59.710 --> 16:01.730
Say, what happened to Funny-chan?

16:01.730 --> 16:05.220
But aren't you tired, Gramps?

16:05.220 --> 16:06.680
Not at all!

16:06.680 --> 16:11.950
That woman is so beautiful
I could never get tired of her.

16:14.290 --> 16:17.950
You still won't give up,
after all that?

16:18.260 --> 16:20.540
Funny-chaaan...!

16:21.900 --> 16:26.500
If that's how it's going to be,
I'll date you into submission!

16:43.020 --> 16:45.620
This is not good.

16:45.620 --> 16:50.030
Before I knew it, he had me
marching at his pace...

16:50.030 --> 16:51.490
However...

16:52.760 --> 16:55.870
I'm exhausted, Corne-san.

16:55.870 --> 16:59.280
I suppose it's natural,
after running around so much.

16:59.280 --> 17:04.070
I'll go buy you one of those
trendy drinks.   Be right back!

17:07.950 --> 17:09.610
Are you okay?

17:09.610 --> 17:12.650
I've utterly run out of energy.

17:12.650 --> 17:14.300
W-wait a sec!

17:14.820 --> 17:16.790
Gramps is gonna be back soon.

17:16.790 --> 17:18.720
What now, Chocolat-chan?

17:19.590 --> 17:20.960
My last resort, that's what.

17:20.960 --> 17:22.990
Vanilla, lend me your power!

17:22.990 --> 17:25.360
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

17:26.300 --> 17:28.900
Sugar Sugar Rune, Vani Rune!

17:30.130 --> 17:32.600
Become Funny!

17:32.600 --> 17:35.440
Noo, Chocolat!
What're you doing to me?!

17:37.660 --> 17:42.610
Saule, I'm leaving Gramps to
you until Nana wakes up.

17:42.610 --> 17:43.870
Chocolat!

17:45.020 --> 17:46.680
Funny-chan!

17:46.680 --> 17:48.080
Shoot, it's Gramps.

17:48.080 --> 17:52.590
Funny-chan! They mix some
great coconut juice here.

17:52.590 --> 17:53.840
Oh!

17:53.840 --> 17:55.560
"Oh"?

17:55.560 --> 17:59.060
Oh my, what's come over me?

17:59.060 --> 18:00.560
Oh my, looks yummy!

18:03.370 --> 18:05.540
It's so delicious, it is!

18:06.270 --> 18:10.040
Is it just me, or are you talking
differently from before?

18:10.040 --> 18:11.480
What you talkin' about?

18:11.480 --> 18:16.780
I ain't– I am not talking any
different than before, no siree!

18:23.080 --> 18:25.900
Okay then!
Let's go climb that hill...

18:25.900 --> 18:29.170
and take in a little
nighttime scenery.

18:30.160 --> 18:33.630
Ah, wait, Gramps...
I mean, Corne-san!

18:38.700 --> 18:41.110
Beautiful starry sky, isn't it?

18:41.110 --> 18:43.600
Yes, it indeed is beautiful...

18:43.910 --> 18:45.910
And the nighttime scenery
is beautiful, too.

18:45.910 --> 18:48.100
Y-yes.

18:48.100 --> 18:52.180
Chocolat, I'm at my limit here...

18:52.180 --> 18:53.780
Funny-chan...

18:57.460 --> 18:58.790
G-Gramps...!

18:59.420 --> 19:00.570
I need to use the restroom!

19:04.280 --> 19:06.100
Chocolat.

19:06.100 --> 19:07.500
I'm so sorry, Saule.

19:07.500 --> 19:10.630
Seems like we're all
at our limits here.

19:10.630 --> 19:12.300
Wait a sec!

19:12.300 --> 19:14.040
Funny-chan, what kept you?

19:14.870 --> 19:16.140
Corne-dono...

19:16.140 --> 19:17.710
What is it, old crone?

19:17.710 --> 19:19.910
I've come to apologize.

19:19.910 --> 19:22.910
I won't deceive you
anymore, Corne-dono.

19:24.050 --> 19:28.250
I was fed up with
your shameless behavior,

19:28.250 --> 19:31.060
so I wanted to tease you a bit.

19:31.060 --> 19:35.290
I hope you'll forgive me for
going a little overboard.

19:35.290 --> 19:37.820
What? I knew it all along.

19:37.820 --> 19:41.820
Don't worry about it.
Besides, I had a lot of fun.

19:42.270 --> 19:46.000
Why did you come here
today on vacation?

19:46.000 --> 19:47.870
Was it just to meet women?

19:47.870 --> 19:49.040
Of course not!

19:49.040 --> 19:52.340
Though I guess things
did turn out that way.

19:52.340 --> 19:55.540
Maybe I went a little overboard too.

19:56.850 --> 20:00.810
All I really wanted was to make
Chocolat a little happier.

20:02.010 --> 20:07.560
Every once in a while,
she shows signs of being lonely.

20:07.560 --> 20:10.060
Chocolat gets lonely?

20:10.430 --> 20:14.100
You wouldn't know it from
the way she acts, but...

20:14.100 --> 20:17.030
you can see
the loneliness on her face.

20:17.500 --> 20:20.910
So I was wondering how she'd been,
since I hadn't seen her in awhile.

20:20.910 --> 20:22.040
Corne-dono...

20:22.040 --> 20:26.040
There's nothing happier in this
world than the smile of a child.

20:29.160 --> 20:33.790
Waffle-sama, you have a lovely smile.

20:33.790 --> 20:38.490
Gramps, you tried so hard
to make me happy...

20:39.190 --> 20:43.010
and yet, I tried so hard
to make you go home.

20:43.010 --> 20:44.730
Chocolat-chan.

20:46.660 --> 20:47.830
Gramps!

21:02.410 --> 21:05.020
I feel so happy, Houx-sama.

21:05.020 --> 21:08.080
Somebody help me!

21:10.150 --> 21:13.060
I'll drop by again sometime.

21:13.060 --> 21:14.890
We'll be waiting for you.

21:14.890 --> 21:16.860
Oh, where did Houx go?

21:16.860 --> 21:17.960
He's...

21:20.860 --> 21:22.330
See you later!

21:23.070 --> 21:24.170
Corne-dono...

21:24.170 --> 21:25.560
What is it now?

21:25.560 --> 21:26.970
Oh no, nothing at all.

21:26.970 --> 21:29.070
That reminds me...

21:29.070 --> 21:34.060
Why don't we throw a fancy party
with the cute bears next time?

21:34.060 --> 21:39.310
I think you misunderstand!
It has to be with froggies!

21:39.310 --> 21:41.780
Then why not have both?

21:44.320 --> 21:48.390
I don't care what you do,
as long as it doesn't get out of hand.

21:48.390 --> 21:50.330
Otherwise, I'll whup your butts!

21:50.330 --> 21:52.300
All too easy.

21:52.300 --> 21:55.200
Bye bye now!

21:55.870 --> 21:58.300
And to all a good night!

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
